('B', '**Significance:** distress out of proportion to the stressor (taking culture into account) and/or significant impairment in social, work, or other functioning.'),
('B', '**Exclusions:** does not meet criteria for another disorder and is not just a flare of an existing one; is not normal grief or prolonged grief disorder.'),
('B', '**Course:** once the stressor or its consequences end, symptoms resolve **within 6 months**. Specify acute (under 6 months) or persistent (6 months or more, for ongoing stressors).'),
